                                <button class="btn btn-success fw-bold d-flex align-items-center gap-1" id="financial-new-repasse-btn" style="height: 36px; padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; background-color: #00a65a; border-color: #008d4c;">
                                    <i class="ph-plus-circle"></i> Solicitar Repasse
