                                        <div class="position-absolute bottom-0 start-0 w-100 bg-dark bg-opacity-75 text-white py-1 px-2 d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center" style="font-size: 10px;">
                                            <span>Curitiba Metropol. (Pontos Habilitados)</span>
                                            <span class="text-success"><i class="ph-circle-fill me-1 fs-xxs"></i>Todos Ativos</span>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <!-- Real-Time Simulation Panel -->
                                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-3" style="border-radius: 12px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1e3a8a 0%, #1e1b4b 100%); color: #fff;">
                                    <div class="card-body p-3 text-start">
                                        <h6 class="fw-bold text-white mb-2"><i class="ph-lightning text-warning me-1"></i> Simulador de Vendas Físicas</h6>
                                        <p class="text-slate-300 fs-xs mb-3">Clique no botão abaixo para disparar uma transação de compra física em um PDV randômico no mapa e atualizar o painel.</p>
                                        <button class="btn btn-warning btn-sm w-100 fw-bold text-dark mb-2" onclick="window.simulatePDVSale()"><i class="ph-play-fill me-1"></i> Simular Venda Física</button>
                                        <div class="text-slate-400 font-monospace fs-xxs border-top border-white border-opacity-10 pt-2 mt-2" id="pdv-simulation-log">
                                            Status: Aguardando nova simulação...
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <!-- Alert operational panel -->
                                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-3 text-start" style="border-radius: 12px;">
                                    <div class="card-header bg-transparent border-bottom py-2.5 px-3">
                                        <h6 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-0"><i class="ph-bell-ringing text-danger me-1"></i> Alertas Operacionais (Sistema)</h6>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="card-body p-3">
                                        <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2" id="pdv-alerts-container" style="font-size: 12px;">
                                            <div class="alert alert-info py-1.5 px-2.5 mb-0 border-0 d-flex gap-2 align-items-start">
                                                <i class="ph-info fs-base text-info mt-0.5"></i>
                                                <div>
                                                    <span class="fw-bold text-dark d-block">Sincronização Ativa</span>
                                                    <span class="text-muted fs-xxs">Conexão redundante com adquirentes operacional.</span>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="alert alert-warning py-1.5 px-2.5 mb-0 border-0 d-flex gap-2 align-items-start">
                                                <i class="ph-warning-circle fs-base text-warning mt-0.5"></i>
                                                <div>
                                                    <span class="fw-bold text-dark d-block">Estoque Bobina CX-002</span>
                                                    <span class="text-muted fs-xxs">Nível estimado do papel de impressão em 15% no Mueller.</span>
                                                </div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>

                                <!-- Ranking e KPIs consolidado -->
                                <div class="card border-0 shadow-sm mb-3 text-start" style="border-radius: 12px;">
                                    <div class="card-header bg-transparent border-bottom py-2.5 px-3">
                                        <h6 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-0"><i class="ph-trophy text-warning me-1"></i> Ranking de Faturamento</h6>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="card-body p-3">
                                        <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2" style="font-size: 13px;">
                                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                                                <span>🥇 1º Shopping Mueller</span>
                                                <span class="fw-bold font-monospace">R$ 46.520</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="progress" style="height: 6px;">
                                                <div class="progress-bar bg-primary" role="progressbar" style="width: 100%;"></div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mt-1">
                                                <span>🥈 2º Teatro Guaíra</span>
                                                <span class="fw-bold font-monospace">R$ 42.380</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="progress" style="height: 6px;">
                                                <div class="progress-bar bg-success" role="progressbar" style="width: 91%;"></div>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mt-1">
                                                <span>🥉 3º Teatro Positivo</span>
                                                <span class="fw-bold font-monospace">R$ 38.740</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <div class="progress" style="height: 6px;">
