                                                <span class="fs-xxs text-muted font-monospace">application/json</span>
                                            </div>
                                            <pre class="mb-0 text-white font-monospace fs-xxs" style="max-height: 200px; overflow-y: auto;" id="api-console-response">{
  "message": "Selecione um endpoint e clique em Executar para visualizar a resposta JSON da API."
}</pre>
                                        </div>
