                        <!-- EXEMPLO 3: GRUPO DE LISTA (.LIST-GROUP) -->
                        <div class="card shadow-sm mb-4" style="border-radius: 8px;">
                            <div class="card-header bg-white py-3 border-bottom d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                                <div>
                                    <h6 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-0"><i class="ph-list-bullets me-2 text-primary"></i>3. Exemplo com Grupo de Lista (.list-group)</h6>
                                    <span class="text-muted fs-xs">Integração nativa com elementos .list-group-item mantendo sincronismo preciso durante o scroll.</span>
                                </div>
                                <span id="badge-active-listgroup" class="badge bg-secondary px-2 py-1 fs-xxs">Ativo: Item 1</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-body p-3">
                                <div class="row g-3">
                                    <div class="col-lg-4 col-md-5">
                                        <div id="scrollspy_list_group" class="list-group">
                                            <a class="list-group-item list-group-item-action active fw-semibold" href="#list-item-1"><i class="ph-caret-right me-1"></i> Item 1</a>
                                            <a class="list-group-item list-group-item-action fw-semibold" href="#list-item-2"><i class="ph-caret-right me-1"></i> Item 2</a>
                                            <a class="list-group-item list-group-item-action fw-semibold" href="#list-item-3"><i class="ph-caret-right me-1"></i> Item 3</a>
                                            <a class="list-group-item list-group-item-action fw-semibold" href="#list-item-4"><i class="ph-caret-right me-1"></i> Item 4</a>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-lg-8 col-md-7">
                                        <div id="scrollspy-container-listgroup" data-bs-spy="scroll" data-bs-target="#scrollspy_list_group" data-bs-offset="10" class="scrollspy-list-container" tabindex="0">
                                            <h5 id="list-item-1">Item 1</h5>
                                            <p class="mb-3">Este é um conteúdo de exemplo para a página do Scrollspy. Observe que, ao rolar a página para baixo, o link de navegação correspondente é destacado. Isso se repete ao longo do exemplo do componente. Continuamos adicionando mais textos de exemplo aqui para enfatizar a rolagem e o destaque.</p>
                                            
                                            <h5 id="list-item-2">Item 2</h5>
                                            <p class="mb-3">Este é um conteúdo de exemplo para a página do Scrollspy. Observe que, ao rolar a página para baixo, o link de navegação correspondente é destacado. Isso se repete ao longo do exemplo do componente. Continuamos adicionando mais textos de exemplo aqui para enfatizar a rolagem e o destaque.</p>
                                            
                                            <h5 id="list-item-3">Item 3</h5>
                                            <p class="mb-3">Este é um conteúdo de exemplo para a página do Scrollspy. Observe que, ao rolar a página para baixo, o link de navegação correspondente é destacado. Isso se repete ao longo do exemplo do componente. Continuamos adicionando mais textos de exemplo aqui para enfatizar a rolagem e o destaque.</p>
                                            
                                            <h5 id="list-item-4">Item 4</h5>
                                            <p class="mb-3">Este é um conteúdo de exemplo para a página do Scrollspy. Observe que, ao rolar a página para baixo, o link de navegação correspondente é destacado. Isso se repete ao longo do exemplo do componente. Continuamos adicionando mais textos de exemplo aqui para enfatizar a rolagem e o destaque.</p>
                                        </div>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- PAINEL MONITOR DE EVENTOS & CONSOLE -->
                        <div class="card shadow-sm mb-4" style="border-radius: 8px;">
                            <div class="card-header bg-white py-3 border-bottom d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                                    <h6 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-0"><i class="ph-terminal-window me-2 text-primary"></i>Monitor de Eventos (activate.bs.scrollspy)</h6>
                                    <span class="badge bg-success bg-opacity-10 text-success border border-success border-opacity-20 px-2 py-0.5 fs-xxs">Escuta Ativa</span>
                                </div>
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-xs btn-light border text-muted" id="btn-scrollspy-clear-logs">
                                    <i class="ph-eraser me-1"></i> Limpar Histórico
                                </button>
                            </div>
                            <div class="card-body p-0">
                                <div id="scrollspy-event-log-container" style="max-height: 220px; overflow-y: auto; background-color: #f8fafc;" class="p-2">
                                    <div class="text-muted fs-xs p-2 text-center">Nenhum evento registrado ainda. Role os exemplos para testar!</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </section>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- ==========================================================================
       MODALS OVERLAYS (CUSTOM DIALOG SYSTEM FOR COMPATIBILITY)
       ========================================================================== -->
    <!-- MODAL 1: NOVO EVENTO (Cadastro Rápido) -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-new-event">
        <div class="modal-content" style="max-width: 580px;">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <span class="modal-title fw-bold"><i class="ph-calendar-plus text-orange me-2"></i> Novo Evento - Cadastro Rápido</span>
                <button class="btn-close-modal" onclick="closeModal('new-event')">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <form id="quick-new-event-form">
                <div class="modal-body">
                    <div class="row g-3">
                        <div class="col-12">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold fs-xs text-muted text-uppercase">Nome do Evento</label>
                            <input type="text" id="modal-ev-name" class="form-control" placeholder="Ex: Show de Rock Curitiba" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold fs-xs text-muted text-uppercase">Data / Hora</label>
                            <input type="text" id="modal-ev-date" class="form-control" placeholder="Ex: Sáb, 11/07/2026 - 11:00" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold fs-xs text-muted text-uppercase">Local</label>
                            <input type="text" id="modal-ev-location" class="form-control" placeholder="Ex: Teatro Positivo" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold fs-xs text-muted text-uppercase">Identificador Externo</label>
                            <input type="text" id="modal-ev-badge-l" class="form-control" placeholder="Ex: 3195" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold fs-xs text-muted text-uppercase">Identificador Interno</label>
                            <input type="text" id="modal-ev-badge-r" class="form-control" placeholder="Ex: 3292" required>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm" onclick="closeModal('new-event')">Cancelar</button>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-orange text-white fw-bold btn-sm">Criar Evento</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- MODAL 2: CONFIRMAÇÃO & SUCESSO DE REPASSE -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-request-repasse">
        <div class="modal-content" style="max-width: 580px;">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <span class="modal-title fw-bold"><i class="ph-hand-coins text-green me-2"></i> Solicitação de Repasse</span>
                <button class="btn-close-modal" onclick="closeModal('request-repasse')">&times;</button>
            </div>
            
            <!-- STEP 4 PANEL: Final Confirmation -->
            <div class="modal-body repasse-wizard-pane" id="repasse-wizard-pane-4" style="display: none; text-align: center; padding: 30px 20px;">
                <i class="ph-question text-primary fs-1 mb-3"></i>
                <h3 class="fw-bold mb-2 fs-5 text-dark">Confirmar Solicitação?</h3>
                <p class="text-muted fs-sm mb-4">Verifique os dados da sua transferência abaixo antes de concluir.</p>
                <div class="payout-card-summary text-start mx-auto" style="max-width: 480px;">
                    <div class="payout-sum-row">
                        <span>Valor:</span>
                        <strong class="fs-sm text-success" id="payout-confirm-value">R$ 248,96</strong>
                    </div>
                    <div class="payout-sum-row">
                        <span>Conta:</span>
                        <span id="payout-confirm-account" class="fw-bold text-dark">Banco Inter</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="payout-sum-row">
                        <span>Forma/Chave:</span>
                        <span id="payout-confirm-method" class="fw-bold text-dark">PIX (financeiro@empresa.com.br)</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- STEP 5 PANEL: Repasse em Processamento (Sucesso) -->
            <div class="modal-body repasse-wizard-pane" id="repasse-wizard-pane-5" style="display: none; padding: 24px;">
                <div class="text-center mb-4">
                    <i class="ph-check-circle text-success fs-1 mb-2"></i>
                    <h3 class="fw-bold text-dark">Solicitação enviada com sucesso!</h3>
                    <p class="text-muted fs-sm mb-0">Seu pedido foi incluído no fluxo de auditoria interna.</p>
                </div>
                
                <div class="payout-card-summary mx-auto" style="max-width: 580px;">
                    <div class="payout-sum-row">
                        <span>Número da Solicitação:</span>
                        <strong id="success-payout-id">#REP000458</strong>
                    </div>
                    <div class="payout-sum-row">
                        <span>Valor:</span>
                        <strong id="success-payout-value" class="text-success">R$ 248,96</strong>
                    </div>
                    <div class="payout-sum-row">
                        <span>Previsão:</span>
                        <strong id="success-payout-date">08/07/2026</strong>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Lifecycle timeline tracking step node -->
                <div class="progress-stepper-tracker mx-auto" style="max-width: 580px; margin-top: 24px;">
                    <div class="progress-line-track"></div>
                    <div class="progress-line-fill" id="payout-lifecycle-line" style="width: 33.33%;"></div>
                    <div class="progress-tracker-node completed">
                        1
                        <span class="progress-node-label" style="color: #10b981;">Solicitado</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="progress-tracker-node active">
                        2
                        <span class="progress-node-label" style="color: #3b82f6;">Em Análise</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="progress-tracker-node">
                        3
                        <span class="progress-node-label">Processando</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="progress-tracker-node">
                        4
                        <span class="progress-node-label">Pago</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <!-- Criptographed Payout Audit logs -->
                <div class="payout-audit-log-block mx-auto" id="payout-audit-logs" style="max-width: 580px;">
                    <!-- Filled dynamically via JS -->
                </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Modal footer buttons with dynamic state management -->
            <div class="modal-footer" id="repasse-wizard-footer">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm" id="btn-repasse-prev" onclick="navigateRepasseWizard(-1)">Voltar</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm fw-bold" id="btn-repasse-next" onclick="navigateRepasseWizard(1)">Solicitar Repasse ao Financeiro Disk</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- MODAL 3: BALANÇO (Detalhamento do Evento) -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-balance">
        <div class="modal-content" style="max-width: 500px;">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <span class="modal-title fw-bold"><i class="ph-scales text-green me-2"></i> Balanço e Detalhamento</span>
                <button class="btn-close-modal" onclick="closeModal('balance')">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-3">
                    <div class="fw-bold text-dark fs-sm" id="balance-event-name">EVENTO DE TESTE – TESTE</div>
                    <div class="border rounded p-3 bg-light bg-opacity-30">
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mb-2 fs-xs">
                            <span>Valor Bruto Arrecadado:</span>
                            <strong class="text-dark" id="balance-gross">R$ 78,00</strong>
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mb-2 fs-xs text-danger">
                            <span>Taxa da Plataforma (10%):</span>
                            <span id="balance-tax-platform">- R$ 7,80</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mb-2 fs-xs text-danger">
                            <span>Taxa de Processamento Cartão (5%):</span>
                            <span id="balance-tax-card">- R$ 3,90</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mb-2 fs-xs text-danger">
                            <span>Retenções / Aluguel POS:</span>
                            <span id="balance-retention">- R$ 17,34</span>
                        </div>
                        <hr class="my-2 border-light">
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-between fw-bold fs-sm text-success">
                            <span>Valor Líquido do Repasse:</span>
                            <span id="balance-net">R$ 248,96</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm fw-bold" onclick="closeModal('balance')">Fechar Balanço</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- MODAL 4: ANTECIPAR (Simulador Financeiro) -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-anticipate">
        <div class="modal-content" style="max-width: 500px;">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <span class="modal-title fw-bold"><i class="ph-trend-up text-green me-2"></i> Antecipar Recebíveis</span>
                <button class="btn-close-modal" onclick="closeModal('anticipate')">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <form id="anticipate-sim-form" onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); alert('Antecipação efetuada com sucesso!'); closeModal('anticipate');">
                <div class="modal-body">
                    <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-3">
                        <p class="text-muted fs-xs mb-0">Simule a antecipação de receitas de vendas futuras do evento. Taxa administrativa de antecipação: 3,5%.</p>
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold fs-xs text-muted text-uppercase">Valor Bruto a Antecipar</label>
                            <input type="number" id="anticipate-gross-input" class="form-control" step="1" min="100" value="1000" oninput="calculateAnticipationSim()" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="border rounded p-3 bg-success bg-opacity-10 text-dark">
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mb-2 fs-xs">
                                <span>Valor Bruto Simulado:</span>
                                <span id="sim-gross" class="fw-bold">R$ 1.000,00</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mb-2 fs-xs text-danger">
                                <span>Taxa de Antecipação (3.5%):</span>
                                <span id="sim-tax" class="fw-bold">- R$ 35,00</span>
                            </div>
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between mb-2 fs-xs text-danger">
                                <span>Taxa Plataforma + Cartão (15%):</span>
                                <span id="sim-fees" class="fw-bold">- R$ 150,00</span>
                            </div>
                            <hr class="my-2 border-success border-opacity-20">
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between fw-bold fs-sm text-success">
                                <span>Valor Líquido Creditado:</span>
                                <span id="sim-net" style="font-weight: 800;">R$ 815,00</span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm" onclick="closeModal('anticipate')">Cancelar</button>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-success btn-sm fw-bold">Confirmar Antecipação</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- MODAL 5: UTM LINK BUILDER -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-utm-builder">
        <div class="modal-content" style="max-width: 550px;">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <span class="modal-title fw-bold"><i class="ph-link text-primary me-2"></i> Gerador de Link UTM</span>
                <button class="btn-close-modal" onclick="closeModal('utm-builder')">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <form id="utm-builder-form" onsubmit="handleGenerateUtmLink(event)">
                <div class="modal-body">
                    <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-3">
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold fs-xs text-muted text-uppercase">URL do Evento</label>
                            <input type="text" id="utm-base-url" class="form-control" readonly>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row g-3">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label fw-bold fs-xs text-muted text-uppercase">Origem (utm_source)*</label>
                                <input type="text" id="utm-source" class="form-control form-control-sm" placeholder="Ex: instagram, meta, google" required>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label fw-bold fs-xs text-muted text-uppercase">Meio (utm_medium)*</label>
                                <input type="text" id="utm-medium" class="form-control form-control-sm" placeholder="Ex: stories, bio, cpc, email" required>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="form-group">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold fs-xs text-muted text-uppercase">Nome da Campanha (utm_campaign)*</label>
                            <input type="text" id="utm-campaign" class="form-control form-control-sm" placeholder="Ex: promocao_julho, lancamento_lote2" required>
                        </div>
                        
                        <!-- Generated Link output (initially hidden) -->
                        <div class="d-none border rounded p-3 bg-light text-dark" id="utm-result-container">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold fs-xs text-muted text-uppercase mb-1">Link Gerado:</label>
                            <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                                <input type="text" id="utm-generated-link" class="form-control form-control-sm font-monospace" readonly style="font-size: 11px;">
                                <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm" onclick="copyGeneratedUtmLink()">
                                    <i class="ph-copy"></i>
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm" onclick="closeModal('utm-builder')">Fechar</button>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm fw-bold">Gerar Link</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
    <!-- MODAL 6: FLUXO DE CAIXA -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-cash-flow">
        <div class="modal-content" style="max-width: 650px;">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <span class="modal-title fw-bold"><i class="ph-chart-line-up text-primary me-2"></i> Relatório de Fluxo de Caixa</span>
                <button class="btn-close-modal" onclick="closeModal('cash-flow')">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-3">
                    <p class="text-muted fs-xs mb-0">Visão consolidada das entradas de vendas de ingressos versus repasses liquidados aos produtores nos últimos meses.</p>
                    <div style="height: 250px; position: relative;">
                        <canvas id="chart-financial-cashflow"></canvas>
                    </div>
                    <div class="table-responsive border rounded">
                        <table class="table table-hover align-middle mb-0" style="font-size: 11.5px;">
                            <thead>
                                <tr class="table-light">
                                    <th>Mês</th>
                                    <th class="text-right text-end">Entradas (Vendas)</th>
                                    <th class="text-right text-end">Saídas (Repasses)</th>
                                    <th class="text-right text-end">Saldo Líquido</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody>
                                <tr>
                                    <td><strong>Julho 2026 (Atual)</strong></td>
                                    <td class="text-success text-end">+ R$ 443.346,90</td>
                                    <td class="text-danger text-end">- R$ 258.940,00</td>
                                    <td class="fw-bold text-end">R$ 184.406,90</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>Junho 2026</td>
                                    <td class="text-success text-end">+ R$ 385.120,00</td>
                                    <td class="text-danger text-end">- R$ 310.220,00</td>
                                    <td class="fw-bold text-end">R$ 74.900,00</td>
                                </tr>
                                <tr>
                                    <td>Maio 2026</td>
                                    <td class="text-success text-end">+ R$ 290.450,00</td>
                                    <td class="text-danger text-end">- R$ 245.000,00</td>
                                    <td class="fw-bold text-end">R$ 45.450,00</td>
                                </tr>
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm" onclick="closeModal('cash-flow')">Fechar</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODAL 7: PAGAR SALDO DEVEDOR -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-settle-balance">
        <div class="modal-content" style="max-width: 450px;">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <span class="modal-title fw-bold"><i class="ph-warning-circle text-orange me-2"></i> Pagar Saldo Devedor</span>
                <button class="btn-close-modal" onclick="closeModal('settle-balance')">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-3">
                    <p class="fs-xs text-muted mb-0">O evento <strong id="settle-event-name"></strong> possui saldo devedor de <strong class="text-danger" id="settle-amount-display"></strong>. Realize o pagamento abaixo para regularização junto à plataforma.</p>
                    
                    <!-- Tabs for PIX / Boleto -->
                    <div class="border rounded p-3 bg-light text-center">
                        <span class="fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase d-block mb-2">Pagar via PIX (Copia e Cola)</span>
                        <div class="bg-white p-2 border rounded d-inline-block mb-2">
                            <!-- Simple visual QR Code representation -->
                            <img src="data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='120' height='120' viewBox='0 0 120 120'><rect width='120' height='120' fill='white'/><rect x='10' y='10' width='30' height='30' fill='black'/><rect x='80' y='10' width='30' height='30' fill='black'/><rect x='10' y='80' width='30' height='30' fill='black'/><rect x='20' y='20' width='10' height='10' fill='white'/><rect x='90' y='20' width='10' height='10' fill='white'/><rect x='20' y='90' width='10' height='10' fill='white'/><rect x='50' y='50' width='20' height='20' fill='black'/><rect x='80' y='80' width='10' height='10' fill='black'/><rect x='100' y='100' width='10' height='10' fill='black'/></svg>" width="120" height="120">
                        </div>
                        <div class="input-group input-group-sm mb-1">
                            <input type="text" id="pix-copy-paste-code" class="form-control font-monospace" value="00020101021226870014br.gov.bcb.pix2583pix.diskingressos.com.br/qr/6b29f0412" readonly style="font-size: 10px;">
                            <button class="btn btn-outline-primary" type="button" onclick="navigator.clipboard.writeText(document.getElementById('pix-copy-paste-code').value); alert('Chave PIX copiada!');"><i class="ph-copy"></i></button>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm" onclick="closeModal('settle-balance')">Voltar</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-warning text-white fw-bold btn-sm" onclick="confirmSettleBalancePayment()">Confirmar Regularização</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODAL 8: EVENTOS DO DIA DA AGENDA -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-agenda-day-events">
        <div class="modal-content" style="max-width: 420px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <div class="modal-header bg-primary text-white py-2" style="border-top-left-radius: 8px; border-top-right-radius: 8px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%;">
                <span class="modal-title fw-bold" id="agenda-modal-date" style="color: #fff;"><i class="ph-calendar me-2"></i> Eventos Operacionais</span>
                <button class="btn-close-modal" onclick="closeModal('agenda-day-events')" style="color: #fff; background: none; border: none; font-size: 20px; cursor: pointer;">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body p-3" id="agenda-modal-body" style="max-height: 400px; overflow-y: auto;">
                <!-- Events list loaded here -->
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- AI ASSISTANT WIDGET -->
    <div class="ai-assistant-wrapper">
        <button class="ai-assistant-toggle" id="ai-assistant-toggle-btn" title="Abrir Assistente Virtual">
            <i class="ph-chat-circle-dots"></i>
            <span>Assistente Virtual</span>
        </button>
        <div class="ai-assistant-card" id="ai-assistant-chat-card">
            <div class="ai-assistant-header">
                <div class="ai-assistant-info">
                    <div class="ai-assistant-avatar">
                        <i class="ph-robot text-white"></i>
                        <span class="ai-assistant-status-dot"></span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <h4 class="ai-assistant-title">Suporte DiskIngressos</h4>
                        <span class="ai-assistant-subtitle">Assistente Virtual IA</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <button style="background: none; border: none; color: white; cursor: pointer; font-size: 18px;" id="ai-assistant-close-btn" title="Fechar">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-assistant-body" id="ai-assistant-chat-body">
                <div class="ai-msg received">
                    <div class="ai-msg-bubble">
                        Olá! Sou a Assistente Virtual da DiskIngressos. Conheço todas as novas funções e menus do painel de controle (como <strong>Fluxo de Caixa</strong>, <strong>Receitas Detalhadas</strong>, <strong>Despesas Detalhadas</strong> e <strong>Consulta de Ingressos</strong>). Como posso ajudar você hoje?
                    </div>
                    <span class="ai-msg-time">Agora</span>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-suggestions-panel">
                <button class="ai-suggestion-btn" onclick="sendAiAssistantSuggestion('Como consultar um ingresso?')">Consulta de ingressos</button>
                <button class="ai-suggestion-btn" onclick="sendAiAssistantSuggestion('Onde fica o Fluxo de Caixa?')">Fluxo de Caixa</button>
                <button class="ai-suggestion-btn" onclick="sendAiAssistantSuggestion('Onde vejo o Borderô?')">Borderô</button>
                <button class="ai-suggestion-btn" onclick="sendAiAssistantSuggestion('Como solicitar repasse?')">Solicitar repasse</button>
            </div>
            <div class="ai-assistant-footer">
                <input type="text" class="ai-assistant-input" id="ai-assistant-chat-input" placeholder="Digite sua dúvida ou comando...">
                <button class="ai-assistant-send-btn" id="ai-assistant-send-btn" title="Enviar mensagem"><i class="ph-paper-plane-tilt"></i></button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FLOATING BATCH ACTIONS BAR -->
    <div id="floating-batch-bar" class="card shadow-lg border border-primary p-2 text-white bg-dark position-fixed start-50 translate-middle-x" style="bottom: 24px; z-index: 990; width: 90%; max-width: 680px; display: none; border-radius: 8px;">
        <div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between px-3">
            <span class="fs-xs fw-semibold"><i class="ph-check-square-offset text-primary me-2"></i> <span id="batch-selected-count">0</span> ingresso(s) selecionado(s)</span>
            <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                <button class="btn btn-outline-light btn-sm font-semibold d-flex align-items-center gap-1 py-1" id="batch-resend-btn" style="font-size: 11px;"><i class="ph-paper-plane-tilt"></i> Reenviar</button>
                <button class="btn btn-outline-info btn-sm font-semibold d-flex align-items-center gap-1 py-1" id="batch-validate-btn" style="font-size: 11px;"><i class="ph-check"></i> Validar</button>
                <button class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm font-semibold d-flex align-items-center gap-1 py-1" id="batch-cancel-btn" style="font-size: 11px;"><i class="ph-trash"></i> Cancelar</button>
                <button class="btn btn-light btn-sm font-semibold d-flex align-items-center gap-1 py-1 text-dark" id="batch-export-btn" style="font-size: 11px;"><i class="ph-file-xls"></i> Exportar</button>
                <button class="btn-close btn-close-white ms-2" type="button" aria-label="Close" id="batch-clear-btn"></button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODAL: DETALHES DO INGRESSO -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-ticket-details">
        <div class="modal-content modal-large" style="border-radius: 8px;">
            <div class="modal-header bg-primary text-white py-3" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%;">
                <span class="modal-title fw-bold" id="ticket-modal-title" style="color: #fff;"><i class="ph-ticket me-2"></i> Detalhes do Ingresso</span>
                <button class="btn-close-modal" onclick="closeModal('ticket-details')" style="color: #fff; background: none; border: none; font-size: 20px; cursor: pointer;">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body p-4" style="max-height: 75vh; overflow-y: auto;">
                <div class="row g-4">
                    <!-- Left column: Main Info -->
                    <div class="col-md-7 border-end">
                        <!-- Customer Info Card -->
                        <div class="mb-4">
                            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-2">
                                <h6 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-0 fs-sm"><i class="ph-user me-2 text-primary"></i> Dados do Titular</h6>
                                <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm py-0.5 px-2" id="btn-edit-holder" style="font-size: 10px;"><i class="ph-pencil"></i> Alterar Titularidade</button>
                            </div>
                            
                            <!-- Viewer Mode -->
                            <div id="holder-view-mode" class="bg-light p-3 rounded border">
                                <div class="row g-2">
                                    <div class="col-6"><span class="text-muted d-block" style="font-size: 10px;">NOME</span> <strong id="t-detail-name" class="fs-xs text-dark">-</strong></div>
                                    <div class="col-6"><span class="text-muted d-block" style="font-size: 10px;">CPF</span> <strong id="t-detail-cpf" class="fs-xs text-dark">-</strong></div>
                                    <div class="col-12 mt-2"><span class="text-muted d-block" style="font-size: 10px;">E-MAIL</span> <strong id="t-detail-email" class="fs-xs text-dark">-</strong></div>
                                    <div class="col-12 mt-2"><span class="text-muted d-block" style="font-size: 10px;">TELEFONE</span> <strong id="t-detail-phone" class="fs-xs text-dark">-</strong></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Editor Mode -->
                            <div id="holder-edit-mode" class="bg-light p-3 rounded border" style="display: none;">
                                <div class="row g-2">
                                    <div class="col-md-6">
                                        <label class="form-label" style="font-size: 10px;" for="edit-t-name">NOME</label>
                                        <input type="text" id="edit-t-name" class="form-control form-control-sm">
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-md-6">
                                        <label class="form-label" style="font-size: 10px;" for="edit-t-cpf">CPF</label>
                                        <input type="text" id="edit-t-cpf" class="form-control form-control-sm">
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-12 mt-1">
                                        <label class="form-label" style="font-size: 10px;" for="edit-t-email">E-MAIL</label>
                                        <input type="email" id="edit-t-email" class="form-control form-control-sm">
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-12 mt-1">
                                        <label class="form-label" style="font-size: 10px;" for="edit-t-phone">TELEFONE</label>
                                        <input type="text" id="edit-t-phone" class="form-control form-control-sm">
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="col-12 mt-2 d-flex justify-content-end gap-1">
                                        <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm px-2 py-0.5" style="font-size: 10px;" id="btn-cancel-edit-holder">Cancelar</button>
                                        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm px-2 py-0.5 text-white" style="font-size: 10px;" id="btn-save-edit-holder">Salvar Alteração</button>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Purchase Info -->
                        <div class="mb-4">
                            <h6 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-2 fs-sm"><i class="ph-shopping-cart me-2 text-primary"></i> Detalhes da Compra</h6>
                            <div class="bg-white p-3 rounded border">
                                <div class="row g-3">
                                    <div class="col-4"><span class="text-muted d-block" style="font-size: 10px;">ID PEDIDO</span> <strong id="t-detail-orderid">-</strong></div>
                                    <div class="col-4"><span class="text-muted d-block" style="font-size: 10px;">DATA COMPRA</span> <strong id="t-detail-purchasedate" style="font-size: 11px;">-</strong></div>
                                    <div class="col-4"><span class="text-muted d-block" style="font-size: 10px;">CANAL</span> <strong id="t-detail-channel">-</strong></div>
                                    
                                    <div class="col-4"><span class="text-muted d-block" style="font-size: 10px;">PAGAMENTO</span> <strong id="t-detail-payment">-</strong></div>
                                    <div class="col-4"><span class="text-muted d-block" style="font-size: 10px;">VALOR PAGO</span> <strong id="t-detail-value" class="text-success">-</strong></div>
                                    <div class="col-4"><span class="text-muted d-block" style="font-size: 10px;">CATEGORIA</span> <strong id="t-detail-category">-</strong></div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Validation info -->
                        <div>
                            <h6 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-2 fs-sm"><i class="ph-shield-check me-2 text-primary"></i> Status de Portaria & Acesso</h6>
                            <div id="validation-info-box" class="p-3 rounded border d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between bg-light">
                                <div>
                                    <span class="text-muted d-block" style="font-size: 10px;">CHECK-IN STATUS</span>
                                    <span class="badge" id="t-detail-val-badge">Aguardando</span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="text-end" id="t-detail-val-meta" style="display: none;">
                                    <span class="text-muted d-block" style="font-size: 10px;">REGISTRADO EM</span>
                                    <strong id="t-detail-val-date" class="fs-xxs d-block" style="font-size: 10px;">-</strong>
                                    <span id="t-detail-val-gate" class="fs-xxs fw-bold text-muted" style="font-size: 10px;">-</span>
                                </div>
                                <button class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-primary text-primary fw-semibold" id="btn-toggle-checkin">Validar Check-in</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Right column: Barcode & Audit Log -->
                    <div class="col-md-5">
                        <!-- Barcode representation -->
                        <div class="text-center p-3 border rounded bg-light mb-4">
                            <span class="fs-xxs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase d-block mb-2" style="font-size: 10px;">QR Code de Validação</span>
                            <div class="bg-white p-2 border rounded d-inline-block mb-2">
                                <img id="t-detail-qrcode-img" src="data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='140' height='140' viewBox='0 0 140 140'><rect width='140' height='140' fill='white'/><rect x='10' y='10' width='40' height='40' fill='black'/><rect x='90' y='10' width='40' height='40' fill='black'/><rect x='10' y='90' width='40' height='40' fill='black'/><rect x='20' y='20' width='20' height='20' fill='white'/><rect x='100' y='20' width='20' height='20' fill='white'/><rect x='20' y='100' width='20' height='20' fill='white'/><rect x='60' y='60' width='30' height='30' fill='black'/><rect x='100' y='90' width='10' height='10' fill='black'/><rect x='90' y='110' width='20' height='20' fill='black'/></svg>" width="130" height="130" alt="QR Code">
                            </div>
                            <code class="d-block text-dark font-monospace fw-bold mb-1" id="t-detail-code" style="font-size: 12px;">TK-15677824</code>
                            <span class="text-muted" style="font-size: 10px;">Setor: <strong id="t-detail-sector">Pista</strong></span>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Audit History Log -->
                        <div>
                            <h6 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-2 fs-sm"><i class="ph-clock-counter-clockwise me-2 text-primary"></i> Histórico de Atividade</h6>
                            <div class="border rounded bg-white p-2" style="max-height: 180px; overflow-y: auto;">
                                <ul class="list-unstyled mb-0" id="t-detail-history-list" style="font-size: 10.5px; line-height: 1.4;">
                                    <!-- Carregado via JS -->
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer bg-light" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; width: 100%;">
                <div>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-danger btn-sm text-danger font-semibold" id="btn-cancel-ticket"><i class="ph-trash"></i> Cancelar / Estornar</button>
                </div>
                <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm font-semibold" id="btn-detail-resend"><i class="ph-paper-plane-tilt"></i> Reenviar E-mail</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-light border btn-sm text-dark font-semibold" id="btn-detail-download"><i class="ph-download"></i> Baixar PDF</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm text-dark font-semibold" onclick="closeModal('ticket-details')">Fechar</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODAL: EMITIR CORTESIA (GLOBAL CONTEXT) -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-issue-courtesy">
        <div class="modal-content" style="max-width: 500px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <div class="modal-header bg-purple text-white py-3" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%; background-color: #7c3aed;">
                <span class="modal-title fw-bold" style="color: #fff;"><i class="ph-gift me-2"></i> Emitir Cortesia</span>
                <button class="btn-close-modal" onclick="closeModal('issue-courtesy')" style="color: #fff; background: none; border: none; font-size: 20px; cursor: pointer;">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <form id="modal-cortesia-issuance-form">
                <div class="modal-body p-4">
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="mc-event-selector">Selecionar Evento:</label>
                        <select class="form-select form-select-sm fw-bold border-secondary" id="mc-event-selector" required title="Evento da cortesia">
                            <!-- Opções dinâmicas -->
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row g-2 mb-3">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="mc-sector">Setor / Modalidade:</label>
                            <select class="form-select form-select-sm fw-semibold" id="mc-sector" required title="Setor do ingresso cortesia">
                                <option value="Pista" selected>Pista</option>
                                <option value="Pista Premium">Pista Premium</option>
                                <option value="Camarote">Camarote</option>
                                <option value="VIP Especial">VIP Especial</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="mc-reason">Motivo da Cortesia:</label>
                            <select class="form-select form-select-sm fw-semibold" id="mc-reason" required title="Motivo do convite">
                                <option value="Patrocinador" selected>Patrocinador</option>
                                <option value="Imprensa / Divulgação">Imprensa / Divulgação</option>
                                <option value="Artista / Staff">Artista / Staff</option>
                                <option value="Cortesia Promocional">Cortesia Promocional</option>
                                <option value="Relações Públicas">Relações Públicas</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="mc-name">Nome do Beneficiário:</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="mc-name" placeholder="Nome completo" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="mc-email">E-mail para Envio:</label>
                        <input type="email" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="mc-email" placeholder="beneficiario@email.com" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row g-2 mb-3">
                        <div class="col-md-7">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="mc-cpf">CPF:</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="mc-cpf" placeholder="000.000.000-00">
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-5">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="mc-qty">Quantidade:</label>
                            <input type="number" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="mc-qty" value="1" min="1" max="10" required>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="form-check mb-2">
                        <input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" id="mc-send-email" checked>
                        <label class="form-check-label fs-xs text-muted" for="mc-send-email">
                            Enviar ingresso PDF por e-mail automaticamente
                        </label>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer bg-light">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm" onclick="closeModal('issue-courtesy')">Cancelar</button>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-purple btn-sm text-white fw-bold" style="background-color: #7c3aed; border-color: #7c3aed;"><i class="ph-gift me-1"></i> Emitir Cortesia</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODAL: EMITIR CORTESIA NÃO NOMINAL -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-issue-non-nominal-courtesy">
        <div class="modal-content" style="max-width: 480px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <div class="modal-header text-white py-3" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%; background-color: #6366f1; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
                <span class="modal-title fw-bold" style="color: #fff;"><i class="ph-ticket me-2"></i> Emitir Cortesia Não Nominal</span>
                <button class="btn-close-modal" onclick="closeModal('issue-non-nominal-courtesy')" style="color: #fff; background: none; border: none; font-size: 20px; cursor: pointer;"></button>
            </div>
            <form id="modal-non-nominal-cortesia-form">
                <div class="modal-body p-4">
                    <p class="fs-xs text-muted mb-3"><i class="ph-info me-1"></i> Esta ferramenta gera ingressos cortesias avulsos, sem associar a um nome ou e-mail. Útil para distribuição manual de códigos.</p>
                    
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="mn-event-selector">Selecionar Evento:</label>
                        <select class="form-select form-select-sm fw-bold border-secondary" id="mn-event-selector" required title="Evento da cortesia avulsa">
                            <!-- Opções dinâmicas -->
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row g-2 mb-3">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="mn-sector">Setor / Modalidade:</label>
                            <select class="form-select form-select-sm fw-semibold" id="mn-sector" required title="Setor do ingresso avulso">
                                <option value="Pista" selected>Pista</option>
                                <option value="Pista Premium">Pista Premium</option>
                                <option value="Camarote">Camarote</option>
                                <option value="VIP Especial">VIP Especial</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="mn-reason">Motivo da Cortesia:</label>
                            <select class="form-select form-select-sm fw-semibold" id="mn-reason" required title="Motivo do convite avulso">
                                <option value="Patrocinador" selected>Patrocinador</option>
                                <option value="Imprensa / Divulgação">Imprensa / Divulgação</option>
                                <option value="Artista / Staff">Artista / Staff</option>
                                <option value="Cortesia Promocional">Cortesia Promocional</option>
                                <option value="Relações Públicas">Relações Públicas</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row g-2 mb-2">
                        <div class="col-md-12">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="mn-qty">Quantidade de Ingressos:</label>
                            <input type="number" class="form-control form-control-sm fw-bold" id="mn-qty" value="5" min="1" max="100" required>
                            <span class="fs-xxs text-muted d-block mt-1">Os ingressos gerados serão nomeados como "Portador (Cortesia)" e listados na tabela de ingressos.</span>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer bg-light">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm" onclick="closeModal('issue-non-nominal-courtesy')">Cancelar</button>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm text-white fw-bold" style="background-color: #6366f1; border-color: #6366f1;"><i class="ph-ticket me-1"></i> Gerar Cortesias</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>
    
    <!-- MODAL: CRIAR CUPOM -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-create-coupon">
        <div class="modal-content" style="max-width: 520px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <div class="modal-header text-white py-3" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%; background-color: #f38d4f; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);" id="modal-create-coupon-header">
                <span class="modal-title fw-bold" style="color: #fff;"><i class="ph-ticket me-2"></i> Criar Cupom de Desconto</span>
                <button class="btn-close-modal" type="button" onclick="closeModal('create-coupon')" style="color: #fff; background: none; border: none; font-size: 20px; cursor: pointer;">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <form id="modal-create-coupon-form">
                <div class="modal-body p-4 text-start">
                    
                    <!-- 1. Tipo de Cupom Selection -->
                    <div class="mb-4">
                        <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-2">Como será o cupom?</label>
                        <div class="btn-group w-100" role="group">
                            <input type="radio" class="btn-check" name="coupon-type" id="coupon-type-code" value="code" checked autocomplete="off" onchange="window.toggleCouponTypeFields(this.value)">
                            <label class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm fw-bold w-50 py-2" for="coupon-type-code">
                                <i class="ph-ticket me-1"></i> Por Código
                            </label>
                            
                            <input type="radio" class="btn-check" name="coupon-type" id="coupon-type-link" value="link" autocomplete="off" onchange="window.toggleCouponTypeFields(this.value)">
                            <label class="btn btn-outline-success btn-sm fw-bold w-50 py-2" for="coupon-type-link">
                                <i class="ph-link me-1"></i> Por Link
                            </label>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 2. Campos Específicos para Código -->
                    <div id="coupon-fields-code" class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="cc-code">Código do Cupom:</label>
                        <div class="input-group">
                            <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm fw-bold text-uppercase" id="cc-code" placeholder="Ex: ANIVERSARIO10" required>
                            <button class="btn btn-outline-secondary btn-sm" type="button" onclick="window.generateRandomCouponCode()">Gerar Código</button>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 3. Campos Específicos para Link -->
                    <div id="coupon-fields-link" class="mb-3" style="display: none;">
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="cl-event">Selecionar Evento de Destino:</label>
                            <select class="form-select form-select-sm fw-bold border-secondary" id="cl-event">
                                <!-- Will be populated dynamically -->
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="cl-slug">Identificador do Link (Slug/Parceiro):</label>
                            <div class="input-group">
                                <span class="input-group-text fs-xs bg-light">?cupom=</span>
                                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm fw-bold" id="cl-slug" placeholder="Ex: influencer-maria">
                            </div>
                            <div class="mt-2 p-2 bg-light rounded border text-start">
                                <span class="fs-xxs text-muted text-uppercase d-block fw-bold mb-1">Prévia do Link Gerado:</span>
                                <code class="fs-xxs text-success break-all" id="cl-link-preview" style="word-break: break-all;">https://diskingressos.com.br/evento/...</code>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <!-- 4. Campos Comuns (Desconto, Limite e Validade) -->
                    <div class="row g-2 mb-3">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="cc-discount-type">Tipo de Desconto:</label>
                            <select class="form-select form-select-sm fw-semibold" id="cc-discount-type" required>
                                <option value="percentage" selected>Porcentagem (%)</option>
                                <option value="fixed">Valor Fixo (R$)</option>
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="cc-discount-value">Valor do Desconto:</label>
                            <input type="number" class="form-control form-control-sm fw-bold" id="cc-discount-value" placeholder="Ex: 10" min="1" required>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row g-2 mb-3">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="cc-limit">Limite de Uso:</label>
                            <input type="number" class="form-control form-control-sm fw-bold" id="cc-limit" placeholder="Ex: 100" min="1" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="cc-expiry">Validade:</label>
                            <input type="date" class="form-control form-control-sm fw-bold" id="cc-expiry" required>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer bg-light">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm" onclick="closeModal('create-coupon')">Cancelar</button>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-orange btn-sm text-white fw-bold" id="btn-save-coupon"><i class="ph-check me-1"></i> Criar Cupom</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODAL: NOVO LANCAMENTO FINANCEIRO -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-new-transaction">
        <div class="modal-content" style="max-width: 500px; border-radius: 8px;">
            <div class="modal-header text-white py-3 bg-dark" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.08);">
                <span class="modal-title fw-bold" style="color: #fff;"><i class="ph-currency-dollar me-2"></i> Novo Lançamento Financeiro</span>
                <button class="btn-close-modal" type="button" onclick="closeModal('new-transaction')" style="color: #fff; background: none; border: none; font-size: 20px; cursor: pointer;">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <form id="modal-new-transaction-form" onsubmit="window.saveNewTransaction(event)">
                <div class="modal-body p-4 text-start">
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="tx-type">Tipo de Lançamento:</label>
                        <select class="form-select form-select-sm fw-semibold" id="tx-type" required onchange="window.toggleTxTypeFields(this.value)">
                            <option value="receita" selected>Receita (Contas a Receber)</option>
                            <option value="despesa">Despesa (Contas a Pagar)</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="tx-name" id="tx-name-label">Cliente:</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm fw-semibold" id="tx-name" placeholder="Ex: João da Silva / Fornecedor Som" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3">
                        <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="tx-desc" id="tx-desc-label">Evento / Descrição:</label>
                        <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm fw-semibold" id="tx-desc" placeholder="Ex: Festival de Inverno / Locação de Som" required>
                    </div>
                    <div class="row g-2 mb-3">
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="tx-value">Valor (R$):</label>
                            <input type="number" class="form-control form-control-sm fw-bold" id="tx-value" placeholder="Ex: 1500" min="1" step="0.01" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="col-md-6">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="tx-date" id="tx-date-label">Vencimento:</label>
                            <input type="date" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tx-date" required>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-3" id="tx-status-group">
                        <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1" for="tx-status">Status da Receita:</label>
                        <select class="form-select form-select-sm fw-semibold" id="tx-status">
                            <option value="Aberto" selected>Aberto</option>
                            <option value="Pago">Pago</option>
                            <option value="Atrasado">Atrasado</option>
                        </select>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer bg-light">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm" onclick="closeModal('new-transaction')">Cancelar</button>
                    <button type="submit" class="btn btn-success btn-sm text-white fw-bold"><i class="ph-floppy-disk me-1"></i> Gravar Lançamento</button>
                </div>
            </form>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODAL: CONFIGURACOES DE GATEWAY -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-gateway-config">
