    <!-- MODAL: RESOLUCAO MANUAL COM JUSTIFICATIVA OBRIGATORIA -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-resolver-manual-justificativa" style="display: none; z-index: 1060;">
        <div class="modal-content" style="max-width: 540px; border-radius: 10px;">
            <div class="modal-header bg-white py-3 border-bottom" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%;">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="ph-shield-warning text-warning fs-5"></i>
                    <span class="modal-title fw-bold text-dark">Resolução Manual de Conciliação</span>
                </div>
                <button class="btn-close-modal" type="button" onclick="closeModal('resolver-manual-justificativa')" style="color: #64748b; background: none; border: none; font-size: 20px; cursor: pointer;">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body p-4 text-start bg-white">
                <input type="hidden" id="resolve-manual-item-id">
                <div class="alert alert-info py-2 px-3 mb-3 fs-xs">
                    <i class="ph-info me-1"></i> Esta ação baixa a divergência e gera um registro indelével na <strong>Trilha de Auditoria</strong> com carimbo de tempo e usuário responsável.
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label class="form-label fs-xxs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1">Tipo de Resolução:</label>
                    <select class="form-select form-select-sm fw-semibold" id="resolve-manual-type">
                        <option value="RESOLVIDO_MANUALMENTE" selected>Ajuste Comercial / Tolerância de Taxa</option>
                        <option value="CONCILIADO">Baixa Manual por Comprovante Bancário</option>
                        <option value="BLOQUEADO">Bloqueio Definitivo por Chargeback</option>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-1">
                        <label class="form-label fs-xxs fw-bold text-danger text-uppercase mb-0">Justificativa Operacional (Obrigatória):</label>
                        <span class="fs-xxs text-muted" id="resolve-justification-counter">0 / 10 mín.</span>
                    </div>
                    <textarea class="form-control form-control-sm" id="resolve-manual-justification" rows="4" placeholder="Descreva detalhadamente o motivo da resolução manual, número de chamado de suporte ou acordo comercial..." oninput="window.updateJustificationCounter(this)"></textarea>
                    <div class="invalid-feedback fs-xxs" id="resolve-justification-error">A justificativa deve conter no mínimo 10 caracteres explicativos.</div>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-2">
                    <label class="form-label fs-xxs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1">Operador Responsável:</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm bg-light" id="resolve-manual-operator" value="admin@diskingressos.com.br" readonly>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer bg-light py-2 d-flex justify-content-between">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm fw-bold" onclick="closeModal('resolver-manual-justificativa')">Cancelar</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-success btn-sm fw-bold text-white" onclick="window.submitManualResolution()">
                    <i class="ph-check me-1"></i> Gravar Resolução &amp; Auditoria
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODAL: IMPORTAR EXTRATO OFX / CSV -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-importar-extrato-conciliacao" style="display: none;">
        <div class="modal-content" style="max-width: 580px; border-radius: 10px;">
            <div class="modal-header bg-white py-3 border-bottom" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; width: 100%;">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="ph-upload-simple text-primary fs-5"></i>
                    <span class="modal-title fw-bold text-dark">Importar Extrato Bancário / Adquirente</span>
                </div>
                <button class="btn-close-modal" type="button" onclick="closeModal('importar-extrato-conciliacao')" style="color: #64748b; background: none; border: none; font-size: 20px; cursor: pointer;">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body p-4 text-start bg-white">
                <p class="fs-xs text-muted mb-3">
                    Carregue os arquivos contábeis emitidos pelo seu banco ou adquirente (Stone, Stripe, Cielo, Itaú, Inter) para conferência automática contra o GMV de vendas do DiskIngressos.
                </p>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label class="form-label fs-xxs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1">Instituição de Origem:</label>
                    <select class="form-select form-select-sm fw-semibold" id="modal-import-bank">
                        <option value="itau" selected>Banco Itaú S.A. (Extrato C/C)</option>
                        <option value="inter">Banco Inter S.A. (API Pix / Extrato)</option>
                        <option value="stripe">Stripe Adquirente (Relatório de Payouts)</option>
                        <option value="stone">Stone Pagamentos (Arquivo EDI / MDR)</option>
                        <option value="pagarme">Pagar.me / Stone Co (Liquidações)</option>
                    </select>
                </div>

                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label class="form-label fs-xxs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1">Arquivo de Conciliação (OFX, CSV ou CNAB 240):</label>
                    <input type="file" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="modal-import-file" accept=".ofx,.csv,.txt,.rem,.ret">
                </div>

                <div class="p-3 border rounded bg-light mb-3">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-1">
                        <i class="ph-sparkle text-primary"></i>
                        <strong class="fs-xs text-dark">Regra de Batimento Automático</strong>
                    </div>
                    <p class="fs-xxs text-muted mb-0">
                        O algoritmo faz correspondência por <strong>TID/NSU</strong>, <strong>Valor Líquido</strong> e <strong>Janela Temporal de D+0 a D+3</strong>. Registros divergentes são automaticamente enviados para a fila operacional com diagnóstico prévio.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Progress indicator during simulation -->
                <div id="modal-import-progress" style="display: none;">
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between fs-xxs text-muted mb-1">
                        <span>Processando batimento inteligente...</span>
                        <span id="modal-import-percent">0%</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="progress" style="height: 6px;">
                        <div class="progress-bar progress-bar-striped progress-bar-animated bg-success" id="modal-import-bar" style="width: 0%;"></div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer bg-light py-2 d-flex justify-content-between">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm fw-bold" onclick="closeModal('importar-extrato-conciliacao')">Cancelar</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm fw-bold" id="btn-exec-import-ofx" onclick="window.executeImportExtratoModal()">
                    <i class="ph-sparkle me-1"></i> Processar Arquivo
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>


    <!-- MODAL: TRILHA DE AUDITORIA DE RASTREABILIDADE (FASE 26.17.8.3) -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-rastreabilidade-auditoria" style="display: none; z-index: 1060;">
        <div class="modal-content" style="max-width: 640px; border-radius: 10px;">
            <div class="modal-header bg-white py-3 border-bottom d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="ph-shield-check text-primary fs-5"></i>
                    <span class="modal-title fw-bold text-dark">Trilha de Auditoria Cont&aacute;bil</span>
                </div>
                <button class="btn-close-modal" type="button" onclick="closeModal('rastreabilidade-auditoria')" style="color: #64748b; background: none; border: none; font-size: 20px; cursor: pointer;">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body p-4 text-start bg-white">
                <p class="fs-xs text-muted mb-3">
                    Hist&oacute;rico cronol&oacute;gico indel&eacute;vel de apropria&ccedil;&otilde;es, reconcilia&ccedil;&otilde;es e lan&ccedil;amentos cont&aacute;beis auditados vinculados ao pedido.
                </p>
                <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2" id="trace-audit-list-container">
                    <!-- Loaded dynamically -->
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer bg-light py-2 d-flex justify-content-end">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm fw-bold" onclick="closeModal('rastreabilidade-auditoria')">Fechar</button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODAL: JUSTIFICATIVA DE REABERTURA DE PERÍODO (FASE 26.17.8.6) -->
    <div class="modal-overlay" id="modal-fechamento-reabertura" style="display: none; z-index: 1060;">
        <div class="modal-content" style="max-width: 520px; border-radius: 10px;">
            <div class="modal-header bg-white py-3 border-bottom d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
                <div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                    <i class="ph-warning-octagon text-danger fs-5"></i>
                    <span class="modal-title fw-bold text-dark">Reabertura Excepcional de Compet&ecirc;ncia</span>
                </div>
                <button class="btn-close-modal" type="button" onclick="closeModal('fechamento-reabertura')" style="color: #64748b; background: none; border: none; font-size: 20px; cursor: pointer;">&times;</button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body p-4 text-start bg-white">
                <div class="alert alert-danger py-2 px-3 mb-3 fs-xs">
                    <i class="ph-warning me-1"></i> A reabertura de uma compet&ecirc;ncia fechada desbloqueia lan&ccedil;amentos cont&aacute;beis e exige justificativa formal para auditoria externa.
                </div>
                <div class="mb-3">
                    <label class="form-label fs-xxs fw-bold text-danger text-uppercase mb-1">Motivo / Justificativa (Obrigat&oacute;rio, m&iacute;nimo 10 caracteres):</label>
                    <textarea class="form-control form-control-sm" id="reopen-period-reason" rows="3" placeholder="Informe o parecer cont&aacute;bil ou decis&atilde;o da diretoria que motivou a reabertura da compet&ecirc;ncia..."></textarea>
                </div>
                <div class="mb-2">
                    <label class="form-label fs-xxs fw-bold text-muted text-uppercase mb-1">Auditor / Aprovador:</label>
                    <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm bg-light" value="controladoria@diskingressos.com.br" readonly>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-footer bg-light py-2 d-flex justify-content-between">
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-light btn-sm fw-bold" onclick="closeModal('fechamento-reabertura')">Cancelar</button>
                <button type="button" class="btn btn-danger btn-sm fw-bold text-white" onclick="window.submitReopenPeriod()">
                    <i class="ph-check me-1"></i> Confirmar Reabertura
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>


    <!-- MODAL: Agendar Repasse (Fase 26.17.9.5.7) -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="modal-schedule-payout" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-md modal-dialog-centered">
            <div class="modal-content border-0 shadow">
                <div class="modal-header bg-primary text-white py-2 px-3">
                    <h6 class="modal-title fw-bold fs-sm"><i class="ph-calendar-plus me-1"></i> Novo Agendamento de Repasse</h6>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body p-3">
                    <form id="form-schedule-payout" onsubmit="window.handleSchedulePayoutSubmit(event)">
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Evento de Origem *</label>
                            <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="sch-input-event" required>
                                <!-- Preenchido dinamicamente -->
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row g-2 mb-3">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Valor (R$) *</label>
                                <input type="number" step="0.01" min="1" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="sch-input-amount" required placeholder="0.00">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Data de Vencimento *</label>
                                <input type="date" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="sch-input-duedate" required>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row g-2 mb-3">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Tipo de Repasse</label>
                                <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="sch-input-type">
                                    <option value="PAYOUT_AUTOMATIC">Repasse Automático Programado</option>
                                    <option value="PAYOUT_MANUAL">Repasse Manual Solicitado</option>
                                    <option value="PAYOUT_URGENT">Repasse Emergencial / Prioritário</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Prioridade</label>
                                <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="sch-input-priority">
                                    <option value="NORMAL">Normal</option>
                                    <option value="ALTA">Alta</option>
                                    <option value="CRITICA">Crítica</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Chave PIX / Favorecido</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="sch-input-pix" placeholder="08.123.456/0001-99 (CNPJ Padrão)">
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-end gap-2 mt-4">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-light border" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancelar</button>
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-success fw-bold"><i class="ph-check me-1"></i> Agendar Repasse</button>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODAL: Criar Lote de Repasse (Fase 26.17.9.5.7) -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="modal-create-payout-batch" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-md modal-dialog-centered">
            <div class="modal-content border-0 shadow">
                <div class="modal-header bg-info text-white py-2 px-3" style="background-color: #0284c7 !important;">
                    <h6 class="modal-title fw-bold fs-sm"><i class="ph-stack me-1"></i> Criar Lote de Repasse</h6>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body p-3">
                    <form id="form-create-payout-batch" onsubmit="window.handleCreatePayoutBatchSubmit(event)">
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Título do Lote *</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="batch-input-title" required placeholder="Ex: Lote Diário Repasses Programados - Seg 12/09">
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Data Programada de Execução *</label>
                            <input type="date" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="batch-input-date" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="alert alert-info py-2 px-3 fs-xs mb-3">
                            <i class="ph-info me-1"></i> Os itens selecionados serão vinculados a este lote e submetidos à <strong>reavaliação individual mandatória</strong> no Motor Central de Regras da Fase 26.17.9.5.6.
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-end gap-2 mt-3">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-light border" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancelar</button>
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary fw-bold" style="background-color: #0284c7; border-color: #0284c7;">
                                <i class="ph-check-circle me-1"></i> Criar &amp; Validar Lote
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODAL: Detalhes & Governança do Lote (Fase 26.17.9.5.7) -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="modal-payout-batch-details" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-xl modal-dialog-centered">
            <div class="modal-content border-0 shadow">
                <div class="modal-header bg-dark text-white py-2 px-3">
                    <h6 class="modal-title fw-bold fs-sm" id="modal-batch-details-title"><i class="ph-stack me-1"></i> Detalhes do Lote de Repasse</h6>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body p-3">
                    <!-- Resumo Executivo do Lote -->
                    <div class="card bg-light border-0 p-3 mb-3" id="batch-details-summary-card">
                        <!-- Renderizado dinamicamente -->
                    </div>

                    <!-- Tabela dos Itens do Lote com Decisão do Motor de Regras -->
                    <h6 class="fw-bold text-dark fs-xs text-uppercase mb-2">Itens do Lote &bull; Avaliação do Motor de Regras</h6>
                    <div class="table-responsive mb-3">
                        <table class="table table-sm table-hover align-middle mb-0">
                            <thead class="table-light fs-xs text-uppercase text-muted">
                                <tr>
                                    <th>Item ID</th>
                                    <th>Evento</th>
                                    <th>Valor Solicitado</th>
                                    <th>Decisão Motor</th>
                                    <th>Valor Aprovado</th>
                                    <th>Status Atual</th>
                                    <th>Motivos / Avisos</th>
                                    <th class="text-end">Ações</th>
                                </tr>
                            </thead>
                            <tbody id="batch-details-items-tbody" class="fs-xs">
                                <!-- Renderizado dinamicamente -->
                            </tbody>
                        </table>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Rodapé de Ações de Governança -->
                    <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center pt-2 border-top">
                        <div class="text-muted fs-xs" id="batch-maker-checker-notice">
                            <i class="ph-shield-check me-1 text-primary"></i> <strong>Governança Maker/Checker:</strong> O aprovador deve ser diferente do criador do lote.
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-flex gap-2" id="batch-actions-buttons-container">
                            <!-- Botões dinâmicos de Validação, Aprovação Maker/Checker e Processamento -->
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODAL: Nova Conta Bancária (Fase 26.17.9.4.6) -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="modal-treasury-account-create" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-md modal-dialog-centered">
            <div class="modal-content border-0 shadow">
                <div class="modal-header bg-primary text-white py-2 px-3">
                    <h6 class="modal-title fw-bold fs-sm"><i class="ph-bank me-1"></i> Cadastrar Nova Conta Bancária</h6>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body p-3">
                    <form id="form-treasury-account-create" onsubmit="window.handleNewBankAccountSubmit(event)">
                        <div class="row g-2 mb-2">
                            <div class="col-md-4">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Cód. Banco *</label>
                                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-acc-bankcode" required placeholder="001">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-8">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Nome do Banco *</label>
                                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-acc-bankname" required placeholder="Banco do Brasil">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row g-2 mb-2">
                            <div class="col-md-4">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Agência *</label>
                                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-acc-agency" required placeholder="1502-4">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Conta Corrente *</label>
                                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-acc-account" required placeholder="99201">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-2">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Dígito</label>
                                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-acc-digit" placeholder="0">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row g-2 mb-2">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Titular da Conta *</label>
                                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-acc-holder" required placeholder="DiskIngressos Eventos Ltda">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">CPF/CNPJ do Titular *</label>
                                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-acc-taxid" required placeholder="08.123.456/0001-99">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row g-2 mb-2">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Finalidade da Conta</label>
                                <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="tr-acc-purpose">
                                    <option value="OPERACIONAL">Operacional</option>
                                    <option value="REPASSES">Repasses a Produtores</option>
                                    <option value="ARRECADACAO">Arrecadação de Ingressos</option>
                                    <option value="RESERVA">Reserva de Emergência</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Saldo Inicial (R$)</label>
                                <input type="number" step="0.01" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-acc-balance" placeholder="0.00">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row g-2 mb-3">
                            <div class="col-md-8">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Chave PIX Principal</label>
                                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-acc-pixkey" placeholder="08123456000199">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-4">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Tipo Chave</label>
                                <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="tr-acc-pixtype">
                                    <option value="CNPJ">CNPJ</option>
                                    <option value="CPF">CPF</option>
                                    <option value="EMAIL">E-mail</option>
                                    <option value="PHONE">Telefone</option>
                                    <option value="EVP">Chave Aleatória (EVP)</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-end gap-2">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-light border" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancelar</button>
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary fw-bold"><i class="ph-check me-1"></i> Cadastrar Conta</button>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODAL: Solicitação de Alteração de Alto Risco (Fase 26.17.9.4.6) -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="modal-treasury-account-change" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-md modal-dialog-centered">
            <div class="modal-content border-0 shadow">
                <div class="modal-header bg-warning text-dark py-2 px-3">
                    <h6 class="modal-title fw-bold fs-sm"><i class="ph-shield-warning me-1"></i> Alteração de Domicílio Bancário / PIX (Alto Risco)</h6>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body p-3">
                    <form id="form-treasury-account-change" onsubmit="window.handleRequestAccountChangeSubmit(event)">
                        <input type="hidden" id="tr-chg-acc-id">
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Conta Bancária de Origem</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm bg-light" id="tr-chg-acc-bank" readonly>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Nova Chave PIX (se aplicável)</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-chg-new-pix" placeholder="Nova chave PIX...">
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Novo Número de Conta (se aplicável)</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-chg-new-acc" placeholder="Nova conta...">
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Justificativa Formal *</label>
                            <textarea class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-chg-reason" rows="2" required placeholder="Motivo documentado da alteração cadastral..."></textarea>
                        </div>
                        <div class="alert alert-warning py-2 px-3 fs-xs mb-3">
                            <i class="ph-warning me-1"></i> Esta operação altera dados bancários de alto risco e exige <strong>aprovação de alçada de segurança (Maker/Checker)</strong> antes de ser efetivada.
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-end gap-2">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-light border" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancelar</button>
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-warning fw-bold text-dark"><i class="ph-check me-1"></i> Submeter Solicitação</button>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODAL: Novo Pagamento PIX (Fase 26.17.9.4.6) -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="modal-treasury-pix-create" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-md modal-dialog-centered">
            <div class="modal-content border-0 shadow">
                <div class="modal-header bg-success text-white py-2 px-3" style="background-color: #00a65a !important;">
                    <h6 class="modal-title fw-bold fs-sm"><i class="ph-paper-plane-tilt me-1"></i> Emitir Pagamento Instantâneo PIX</h6>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body p-3">
                    <form id="form-treasury-pix-create" onsubmit="window.handleNewPixPaymentSubmit(event)">
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Conta Bancária de Débito (Origem) *</label>
                            <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="tr-pix-origin-acc" required>
                                <!-- Preenchido dinamicamente -->
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row g-2 mb-2">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Favorecido (Nome / Razão Social) *</label>
                                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-pix-dest-name" required placeholder="Nome do favorecido">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">CPF/CNPJ do Favorecido *</label>
                                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-pix-dest-taxid" required placeholder="00.000.000/0000-00">
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row g-2 mb-2">
                            <div class="col-md-8">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Chave PIX de Destino *</label>
                                <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-pix-dest-key" required placeholder="Chave PIX...">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-4">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Tipo Chave</label>
                                <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="tr-pix-dest-type">
                                    <option value="CNPJ">CNPJ</option>
                                    <option value="CPF">CPF</option>
                                    <option value="EMAIL">E-mail</option>
                                    <option value="PHONE">Telefone</option>
                                    <option value="EVP">Aleatória</option>
                                </select>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="row g-2 mb-2">
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Valor (R$) *</label>
                                <input type="number" step="0.01" min="0.01" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-pix-amount" required placeholder="0.00">
                            </div>
                            <div class="col-md-6">
                                <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Data de Pagamento *</label>
                                <input type="date" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-pix-date" required>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Descrição / Finalidade</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-pix-desc" placeholder="Ex: Pagamento Fornecedor Palco - NF 1234">
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-end gap-2">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-light border" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancelar</button>
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-success fw-bold"><i class="ph-check me-1"></i> Criar Ordem PIX</button>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODAL: Criar Lote de Pagamento Tesouraria (Fase 26.17.9.4.6) -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="modal-treasury-batch-create" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-md modal-dialog-centered">
            <div class="modal-content border-0 shadow">
                <div class="modal-header bg-info text-white py-2 px-3" style="background-color: #0284c7 !important;">
                    <h6 class="modal-title fw-bold fs-sm"><i class="ph-stack me-1"></i> Criar Lote de Pagamento CNAB</h6>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body p-3">
                    <form id="form-treasury-batch-create" onsubmit="window.handleCreateTreasuryBatchSubmit(event)">
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Conta Bancária de Origem *</label>
                            <select class="form-select form-select-sm" id="tr-batch-origin-acc" required>
                                <!-- Preenchido dinamicamente -->
                            </select>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Título do Lote *</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-batch-title" required placeholder="Lote Diário de Pagamentos Fornecedores">
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Data Programada *</label>
                            <input type="date" class="form-control form-control-sm" id="tr-batch-date" required>
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-end gap-2">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-light border" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancelar</button>
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary fw-bold" style="background-color: #0284c7; border-color: #0284c7;">
                                <i class="ph-check-circle me-1"></i> Criar Lote
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    <!-- ================================================================= -->
    <!-- MODAIS DO MÓDULO UNIFICADO DE REPASSES (PRODUTOR & FINANCEIRO)    -->
    <!-- ================================================================= -->

    <!-- MODAL 1: Comprovante Oficial de Repasse (Produtor & Financeiro) -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="modal-payout-receipt-view" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-centered">
            <div class="modal-content border-0 shadow-lg">
                <div class="modal-header bg-dark text-white py-2 px-3">
                    <h6 class="modal-title fw-bold fs-sm d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="ph-receipt text-success fs-5"></i> Comprovante Oficial de Repasse DiskIngressos
                    </h6>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body p-3 bg-light" id="modal-payout-receipt-content">
                    <!-- Preenchido dinamicamente via window.openPayoutReceiptModal() -->
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer bg-white py-2 px-3 d-flex justify-content-between">
                    <span class="fs-xs text-muted"><i class="ph-shield-check text-success me-1"></i> Autenticação Criptografada Homologada</span>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-light border" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Fechar</button>
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary fw-bold d-flex align-items-center gap-1" onclick="window.printPayoutReceipt()">
                            <i class="ph-printer"></i> Imprimir / Salvar PDF
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODAL 2: Aprovação por Alçada Individual (Opção B - Financeiro) -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="modal-approve-single-payout" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-md modal-dialog-centered">
            <div class="modal-content border-0 shadow">
                <div class="modal-header bg-success text-white py-2 px-3" style="background-color: #00a65a !important;">
                    <h6 class="modal-title fw-bold fs-sm"><i class="ph-check-circle me-1"></i> Aprovação Formal por Alçada &bull; Repasse Individual</h6>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body p-3">
                    <div id="approve-single-payout-details">
                        <!-- Carregado via JS -->
                    </div>
                    <form onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); window.confirmApproveSinglePayout();">
                        <div class="mb-2">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Aprovador Responsável (Checker) *</label>
                            <input type="text" class="form-control form-control-sm fw-semibold" id="approve-single-checker-name" value="Controladoria SafeSaff" required>
                            <span class="fs-xxs text-muted">Princípio Maker/Checker: O usuário solicitante não pode aprovar.</span>
                        </div>
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Parecer Formal / Justificativa de Alçada</label>
                            <textarea class="form-control form-control-sm" id="approve-single-notes" rows="2" placeholder="Reserva mínima conferida e alçada hierárquica respeitada. Aprovado para liquidação bancária."></textarea>
                        </div>
                        <div class="alert alert-info py-2 px-3 fs-xs mb-3">
                            <i class="ph-info me-1"></i> Ao confirmar a aprovação, o status do repasse mudará para <strong>Aprovado</strong> tanto no painel interno quanto na visão transparente do Produtor.
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-end gap-2">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-light border" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancelar</button>
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-success fw-bold">
                                <i class="ph-check me-1"></i> Confirmar Aprovação de Alçada
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- MODAL 3: Rejeição de Solicitação de Repasse com Motivo (Financeiro) -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="modal-reject-single-payout" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-md modal-dialog-centered">
            <div class="modal-content border-0 shadow">
                <div class="modal-header bg-danger text-white py-2 px-3">
                    <h6 class="modal-title fw-bold fs-sm"><i class="ph-x-circle me-1"></i> Rejeitar Solicitação de Repasse</h6>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body p-3">
                    <form onsubmit="event.preventDefault(); window.confirmRejectSinglePayout();">
                        <div class="mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-bold">Motivo Documentado da Rejeição *</label>
                            <textarea class="form-control form-control-sm" id="reject-single-reason" rows="3" required placeholder="Informe detalhadamente o motivo que será exibido para o produtor (ex: divergência cadastral, retenção por disputa ou saldo bloqueado)..."></textarea>
                        </div>
                        <div class="alert alert-warning py-2 px-3 fs-xs mb-3">
                            <i class="ph-warning me-1"></i> A rejeição devolverá o valor ao saldo disponível do produtor e registrará a não-conformidade na auditoria.
                        </div>
                        <div class="d-flex justify-content-end gap-2">
                            <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-light border" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancelar</button>
                            <button type="submit" class="btn btn-sm btn-danger fw-bold">
                                <i class="ph-x me-1"></i> Confirmar Rejeição
                            </button>
                        </div>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>
    <!-- ============================================================================ -->
    <!-- CENTRAL DE SOLICITAÇÕES — OFFCANVAS DE DECISÃO & MODAIS OPERACIONAIS            -->
    <!-- ============================================================================ -->

    <!-- Painel Lateral de Decisão Financeira (Offcanvas / Drawer) -->
    <div class="offcanvas offcanvas-end shadow-lg" tabindex="-1" id="offcanvas-approval-decision" style="width: 580px; max-width: 95vw;">
        <div class="offcanvas-header bg-light border-bottom py-3">
            <div>
                <h5 class="offcanvas-title fw-bold text-dark d-flex align-items-center gap-2 mb-0" id="offcanvas-approval-title">
                    <i class="ph-shield-check text-primary fs-4" id="offcanvas-approval-icon"></i> <span id="offcanvas-approval-title-text">Painel de Decisão Financeira</span>
                </h5>
                <div class="text-muted fs-xs" id="offcanvas-approval-subtitle">Backoffice Disk &bull; Controladoria Financeira</div>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="offcanvas" aria-label="Fechar"></button>
        </div>
        <div class="offcanvas-body p-3" id="offcanvas-approval-content">
            <!-- Injetado dinamicamente via financialApprovalsController.openDrawer() -->
        </div>
        <div class="offcanvas-footer p-3 border-top bg-light" id="offcanvas-approval-footer">
            <!-- Ações e botões de decisão injetados dinamicamente com governança Maker/Checker -->
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal 1: Confirmação de Aprovação Formal -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="modal-approval-confirm-approve" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
            <div class="modal-content shadow-lg border-0">
                <div class="modal-header bg-success text-white py-2 px-3">
                    <h6 class="modal-title fw-bold d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="ph-check-circle fs-5"></i> Confirmar Aprovação de Operação
                    </h6>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body p-3">
                    <div class="alert alert-success-subtle border border-success-subtle text-dark py-2 px-3 fs-xs mb-3">
                        <strong class="d-block mb-1">Solicitação: <span id="modal-approve-appr-id" class="font-monospace fw-bold text-success"></span></strong>
                        <span id="modal-approve-appr-desc" class="fs-xs text-muted"></span>
                    </div>
                    <p class="fs-xs text-secondary mb-3">
                        Ao aprovar, a operação avançará para a execução financeira automática. Seus dados cadastrais e carimbo de data/hora serão gravados na trilha de auditoria contábil.
                    </p>
                    <div class="mb-2">
                        <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-semibold text-dark mb-1">Parecer / Observações do Aprovador (opcional):</label>
                        <textarea class="form-control fs-xs" id="input-approve-decision-notes" rows="2" placeholder="Ex: Conferido saldo em conta e documentação válida. Aprovado."></textarea>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer bg-light border-top py-2 px-3">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancelar</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-success fw-bold d-flex align-items-center gap-1" onclick="window.confirmApproveDecision()">
                        <i class="ph-check-bold"></i> Autorizar e Executar
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal 2: Rejeição Definitiva com Motivo Obrigatório -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="modal-approval-confirm-reject" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
            <div class="modal-content shadow-lg border-0">
                <div class="modal-header bg-danger text-white py-2 px-3">
                    <h6 class="modal-title fw-bold d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="ph-x-circle fs-5"></i> Rejeitar Operação Financeira
                    </h6>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body p-3">
                    <div class="alert alert-danger-subtle border border-danger-subtle text-dark py-2 px-3 fs-xs mb-3">
                        <strong class="d-block mb-1">Solicitação: <span id="modal-reject-appr-id" class="font-monospace fw-bold text-danger"></span></strong>
                        <span class="fs-xxs text-danger fw-semibold">Atenção: A rejeição encerra definitivamente esta solicitação e libera os saldos retidos.</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-2">
                        <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-semibold text-dark mb-1">Justificativa da Rejeição (obrigatória):</label>
                        <textarea class="form-control fs-xs" id="input-reject-decision-reason" rows="3" required placeholder="Informe o motivo formal para arquivamento e rejeição..."></textarea>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer bg-light border-top py-2 px-3">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancelar</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-danger fw-bold d-flex align-items-center gap-1" onclick="window.confirmRejectDecision()">
                        <i class="ph-x-bold"></i> Confirmar Rejeição
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal 3: Devolução ao Produtor para Correção -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="modal-approval-confirm-return" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
            <div class="modal-content shadow-lg border-0">
                <div class="modal-header bg-warning text-dark py-2 px-3">
                    <h6 class="modal-title fw-bold d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="ph-arrow-u-up-left fs-5"></i> Devolver Solicitação ao Produtor
                    </h6>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body p-3">
                    <div class="alert alert-warning-subtle border border-warning-subtle text-dark py-2 px-3 fs-xs mb-3">
                        <strong class="d-block mb-1">Solicitação: <span id="modal-return-appr-id" class="font-monospace fw-bold text-dark"></span></strong>
                        <span class="fs-xxs text-muted">A solicitação não será cancelada; o produtor receberá uma notificação para ajustar os dados e reenviar mantendo o mesmo protocolo.</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-2">
                        <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-semibold text-dark mb-1">Orientação / Ajustes Necessários (obrigatório):</label>
                        <textarea class="form-control fs-xs" id="input-return-decision-notes" rows="3" required placeholder="Ex: Por favor anexar a nota fiscal correta e conferir o CNPJ da conta de destino..."></textarea>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer bg-light border-top py-2 px-3">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancelar</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-warning text-dark fw-bold d-flex align-items-center gap-1" onclick="window.confirmReturnDecision()">
                        <i class="ph-paper-plane-tilt"></i> Devolver para Correção
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal 4: Produtor Corrige e Reenvia Solicitação -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="modal-approval-resubmit" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
            <div class="modal-content shadow-lg border-0">
                <div class="modal-header bg-primary text-white py-2 px-3">
                    <h6 class="modal-title fw-bold d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="ph-pencil-simple fs-5"></i> Corrigir e Reenviar Solicitação
                    </h6>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body p-3">
                    <div class="alert alert-warning py-2 px-3 fs-xs mb-3">
                        <strong class="d-block mb-1"><i class="ph-info me-1"></i> Apontamento da Controladoria Financeira:</strong>
                        <div id="modal-resubmit-return-notes" class="fst-italic text-dark"></div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="mb-2">
                        <label class="form-label fs-xs fw-semibold text-dark mb-1">Justificativa Corrigida / Esclarecimentos:</label>
                        <textarea class="form-control fs-xs" id="input-resubmit-justification" rows="3" required placeholder="Descreva os ajustes efetuados para nova análise do Financeiro..."></textarea>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer bg-light border-top py-2 px-3">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancelar</button>
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary fw-bold d-flex align-items-center gap-1" onclick="window.confirmResubmit()">
                        <i class="ph-paper-plane-tilt"></i> Reenviar para Aprovação
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ============================================================================ -->
    <!-- MEGA PACOTE 1: MODAIS DE GESTÃO DE ACESSO & WIZARD DE USUÁRIOS (8 ETAPAS)     -->
    <!-- ============================================================================ -->

    <!-- Modal do Assistente de Criação de Usuário (8 Etapas) -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="modal-access-user-wizard" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-dialog-centered">
            <div class="modal-content shadow-lg border-0">
                <div class="modal-header bg-dark text-white py-2 px-3">
                    <h6 class="modal-title fw-bold d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="ph-user-plus text-primary fs-5"></i> Assistente de Cadastro de Usuário
                    </h6>
                    <span class="badge bg-primary text-white ms-auto me-2 fs-xxs" id="wizard-step-indicator">Etapa 1 de 8</span>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close btn-close-white" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body p-3" id="wizard-user-step-content">
                    <!-- Renderizado dinamicamente via accessManagementController.renderWizardStep() -->
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer bg-light border-top py-2 px-3 d-flex justify-content-between">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Cancelar</button>
                    <div class="d-flex gap-2">
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-secondary" id="btn-wizard-prev" onclick="window.wizardPrevStep()" style="display:none;">
                            <i class="ph-arrow-left me-1"></i> Anterior
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-primary fw-bold" id="btn-wizard-next" onclick="window.wizardNextStep()">
                            Próximo <i class="ph-arrow-right ms-1"></i>
                        </button>
                        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-success fw-bold" id="btn-wizard-finish" onclick="window.confirmCreateUserWizard()" style="display:none;">
                            <i class="ph-check-bold me-1"></i> Concluir e Criar Usuário
                        </button>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Modal de Detalhes e Permissões do Usuário -->
    <div class="modal fade" id="modal-access-user-details" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="modal-dialog modal-dialog-centered">
            <div class="modal-content shadow-lg border-0">
                <div class="modal-header bg-light border-bottom py-2 px-3">
                    <h6 class="modal-title fw-bold text-dark d-flex align-items-center gap-2">
                        <i class="ph-user-focus text-primary fs-5"></i> Ficha Cadastral do Usuário
                    </h6>
                    <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Fechar"></button>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-body p-3" id="modal-user-details-content">
                    <div class="text-center py-3 text-muted">Carregando detalhes do operador...</div>
                </div>
                <div class="modal-footer bg-light border-top py-2 px-3">
                    <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Fechar</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>